><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20251029104337+10'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20251029104339+10'00'" name="b7655099-1830-47e3-bb14-41c3f30be3ef" page="4" coords="306.592621,722.462341,557.651733,722.462341,306.592621,707.701904,557.651733,707.701904,306.592621,711.974487,557.635620,711.974487,306.592621,697.214050,557.635620,697.214050,306.592621,701.543213,557.670776,701.543213,306.592621,686.782776,557.670776,686.782776,306.592621,691.054565,557.650024,691.054565,306.592621,676.294128,557.650024,676.294128,306.592621,680.623291,557.657959,680.623291,306.592621,665.862854,557.657959,665.862854,306.592621,670.135437,557.641907,670.135437,306.592621,655.375000,557.641907,655.375000,306.592621,659.704163,532.376831,659.704163,306.592621,644.943726,532.376831,644.943726" rect="306.131348,644.482422,558.132080,722.923584" subject="Comment on Text" title="alexd"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:25.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Q14c: </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-16.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Furthermore, the findings of this study also identified that commonly used performance metrics such as kill-death ratio are not associated with the amount of time esports players engage in different types of practice. Overall, this study provides new insights into the quantity of practice professional and semi-professional esports players engage in over a competitive year, which can complement the current understanding about the association between practice behaviors and expertise.</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="4" rect="595.276001,630.462341,779.276001,722.462341"
/></highlight
